title: The Presidential Channel
subtitle: A signature, veto or photograph can change Lewica's leverage.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_presidential_channel_timer <= 0 and trz_blocked = 0 and president_name != "" and (presidential_channel_open = 1 or president_relation >= 25)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_presidential_channel_timer = 4
card-image: img/poland/cards/presidential-channel.webp

= The Presidential Channel

[? if president_name = "Andrzej Duda": The Palace accepts a private briefing.
Duda's conflict with parts of PiS is real, but so is his dependence on its
electorate and institutions. A narrow opening can produce a signature, a
veto—or a photograph useful only to him. ?]

[? if president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski" and government_party = "pis":
Trzaskowski's Palace is an opposition institution inside a PiS state. Access
is easy; deciding whether Lewica is coordinating with KO's President or
surrendering its own programme is harder. ?]

[? if president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski" and government_party != "pis":
Trzaskowski's Palace now sits alongside **[+ government_name +]** and its
democratic coalition partners. Access is easy; deciding whether presidential
coordination protects that coalition or lets KO absorb Lewica's programme is
harder. ?]

[? if president_name != "Andrzej Duda" and president_name != "Rafał Trzaskowski":
President **[+ president_name +]** has allowed a direct political channel.
Access does not guarantee a signature, and a Palace photograph can still cost
Lewica more than the meeting delivers. ?]

- @social_dossier
- @court_appeal
- @trz_veto_channel
- @trz_rights_channel
- @public_distance

@social_dossier
title: Offer a bill-by-bill social dossier
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Palace access grows; KO suspects an issue deal.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A serious legislative dossier requires one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; president_relation += 6; household_policy_pressure += 3; administrative_reform_pressure += 1; barons_dissent -= 1; ko_relation -= 3; public_trust += 1; pensioner_support += 3; public_sector_support += 1; last_policy_stage = "Negotiated proposal"; last_policy_authority = "President may lobby; cabinet and Sejm implement"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "The Palace accepts a Left social-policy dossier"

[? if president_name = "Andrzej Duda": Disability support, pensions, labour inspection and
public health are chosen because a presidential signature can be defended to
conservative voters. The channel is useful precisely because it is not an
alliance. ?]

[? if president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski": Disability support, labour inspection, public health and
local finance give the Palace a social agenda that is not only KO's
institutional conflict. The meeting is cooperation, not a coalition. ?]

[? if president_name != "Andrzej Duda" and president_name != "Rafał Trzaskowski":
The dossier forces the current President to answer concrete proposals rather
than a party label. The channel remains transactional, not a coalition. ?]

- #poland_card_finish

@court_appeal
title: Ask the President to veto the next institutional escalation
subtitle: A lawful appeal tests his independence and risks a very public refusal.
view-if: president_name != "Rafał Trzaskowski"
on-arrival: president_relation += 2; judicial_legitimacy += 5; constitutional_restraint += 3; pis_relation -= 3; progressive_credibility += 1; public_trust += 1; urban_progressive_support += 2; turnout_readiness += 1; news_headline = "The Left places the constitutional burden on the President"

The appeal distinguishes ordinary judgments from unlawfully captured bodies and
offers the President a narrow way back from escalation. If he refuses, the
refusal will belong to him.

- #poland_card_finish

@trz_veto_channel
title: Put the next institutional statute on the Palace veto list
subtitle: [? if government_party = "pis": Strengthen the cohabitation front; every veto feeds the right's obstruction campaign.?][? if government_party != "pis": Create a backstop against coalition overreach; any veto becomes part of our governing record.?]
view-if: president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski"
on-arrival: {!
Q.trz_vetoes += 1;
Q.president_relation += 5;
Q.judicial_legitimacy += 5;
Q.constitutional_restraint += 4;
if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
    Q.ko_relation += 2;
    Q.pis_relation -= 4;
    Q.trz_cohabitation_temperature += 4;
    Q.trz_right_backlash += 3;
    Q.pis_poll_momentum += 0.1;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Lewica and the Palace add another PiS statute to the veto list";
} else {
    Q.government_coalition_dissent += 4;
    Q.government_delivery -= 1;
    Q.trz_cohabitation_temperature += 2;
    Q.trz_right_backlash += 1;
    if (Q.government_party == "lewica") {
        Q.party_unity -= 2;
        Q.public_trust -= 1;
    } else if (Q.government_party == "ko") {
        Q.ko_relation -= 3;
        Q.ko_coalition_dissent += 4;
    } else if (Q.government_party == "psl") {
        Q.psl_relation -= 3;
        Q.psl_coalition_dissent += 4;
    } else if (Q.government_party == "p2050") {
        Q.p2050_relation -= 3;
        Q.p2050_coalition_dissent += 4;
    }
    Q.news_headline =
        "Lewica asks the Palace to review a democratic-coalition statute";
}
!}

[? if government_party = "pis": The legal brief separates repairable
provisions from a package designed to capture appointments. Trzaskowski
promises the veto; PiS calls the meeting an opposition government operating
from the Palace.?]

[? if government_party != "pis": The legal brief identifies defects in a
coalition statute before they reach the President. Trzaskowski promises a veto
if they survive. Our governing partners call the meeting an attempt to move a
cabinet dispute to the Palace; because Lewica shares responsibility, any veto
will land on our record too.?]

- #poland_card_finish

@trz_rights_channel
title: Ask for written no-veto pledges on equality laws
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Abortion restoration and marriage equality get signatures in advance.
view-if: president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski"
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A common legislative package requires one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; trz_abortion_signature = 1; trz_marriage_signature = 1; trz_abortion_veto_policy = "Will sign abortion restoration"; trz_marriage_veto_policy = "Will sign marriage equality"; president_relation += 7; progressive_credibility += 5; feminist_trust += 4; psl_relation -= 3; trz_right_fragmentation += 3; trz_right_backlash += 6; far_right_agenda += 3; konf_poll_momentum += 0.25; news_headline = "The Palace issues written no-veto pledges on equality"

The pledges do not create 231 votes. They do remove the Presidency as an excuse
for deputies who claim a rights bill would be futile.

- #poland_card_finish

@public_distance
title: Refuse the Palace photograph
subtitle: Preserve opposition clarity and surrender a possible institutional lever.
on-arrival: {!
Q.president_relation -= 5;
if (Q.president_name == "Rafał Trzaskowski" && Q.trzaskowski_joined_left) {
    Q.party_unity += 1;
} else {
    Q.ko_relation += 2;
}
Q.progressive_credibility += 2;
Q.progressives_dissent -= 1;
Q.barons_dissent += 2;
Q.constitutional_restraint -= 1;
Q.public_trust += 1;
Q.young_support += 1;
Q.news_headline = "The Left declines a presidential display of independence";
!}

[? if president_name = "Andrzej Duda": You will not help Duda perform autonomy while he
signs the rest of PiS's agenda. The democratic opposition applauds. A Palace
aide quietly closes the next available appointment. ?]

[? if president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski" and not trzaskowski_joined_left:
Lewica refuses to become the junior press office of a KO presidency. The party
preserves its line and loses a direct veto channel.?]

[? if president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski" and trzaskowski_joined_left:
Lewica refuses to collapse constitutional distance merely because
Trzaskowski's civic-progressive current now sits inside the party. The Palace
is not described as KO, but the direct veto channel still closes.?]

[? if president_name != "Andrzej Duda" and president_name != "Rafał Trzaskowski":
Lewica refuses to turn Palace access into an endorsement of **[+
president_name +]**. The party preserves its line and loses a direct channel.
?]

- #poland_card_finish
